                           125 *      axes PLC positioning.
                           126 *    - 1. Z to Z safe   - MP 4210.19 : xxx  ;TC pos Z safe
                           127 *    - 2. X to X manual - MP 4210.16 : xxx  ;TC pos X manual
                           128 *    - 3. Y to Y manual - MP 4210.17 : xxx  ;TC pos Y manual
                           129 *    - 4. Z to Z manual - MP 4210.18 : xxx  ;TC pos Z manual
                           130 *
                           131 *  EUMACH
                           132 *    - 5. Y to Y safe   - MP 4231.11 : xxx  ;TC pos Y safe
                           133 *
                           134 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
