                           161 *
                           162 *    single arm              X  X  X  X
                           163 *    pickup Z Y                    X  X
                           164 *    pickup Z                   X
                           165 *    pickup Z X              X
                           166 *    pickup Z X+/X-/Y+/Y-
                           167 *    mag moving with X axis
                           168 *    mag moving to spindle   X  X     X
                           169 *    mag on fixed position         X
                           170 *    no magazine
                           171 *                           (3)   (1)(2)
                           172 *
                           173 *    TC_type_xx ->          01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 10 11 12 13 14 15 16
                           174 *
