                           177 *    TC arm middle position                          X  X  X  X
                           178 *    (as basic position)
                           179 *    TC arm middle position                 X     X     X     X
                           180 *    (for exchange Tspecial)
                           181 *    TC gripper                                X  X        X  X
                           182 *    (output)
                           183 *
                           184 *    TC_type_xx ->          01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 10 11 12 13 14 15 16
