                           345 *      Condition A: Bit 1 of PLC status in TOOL TABLE = (%00000000)
                           346 *      Condition B: Bit 1 of PLC status in TOOL TABLE = (%00000010)
                           347 *      active   -> In condition A, pocket in vertical position after TOOL DEF
                           348 *               -> In condition B, pocket in horizontal position after TOOL DEF
                           349 *
