                             1 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             2 *  Machine Parameter reading
                             3 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             4 *    To read one machine parameter (MP) it is necessary to put in 4 lines
                             5 *    in the constant field "KFIELD MP_definition":
                             6 *
                             7 *    KFIELD MP_definition
                             8 *      K+10                    --> number MP
                             9 *      KL_index_0              --> index MP
                            10 *      KL_type_word            --> typ destination operand (B,W,D)
                            11 *      K&WG_MP10_active_axis   --> destination address MP value
                            12 *      ...
                            13 *      K-1                     --> end constant field
                            14 *    ENDK
                            15 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
