                          1432  *;I_TC_magazine_guard_closed & I_TC_magazine_guard_locked_closed
                          1433  *;Machine with magazine guard
                          1434  *;1. The guard sensor but without lock device (non-servo magazine);
                          1435  *    the guard sensor with lock device (servo magazine)
                          1436  *;2. Operation panel on magazine side with magazine CW/CCW buttons, magazine
                          1437  *;   automatic/manual control mode switch (in automatic control mode, signal
                          1438  *;   = 1), and maybe a emergency stop button
                          1439  *;3. MP4310.4 = $4000 (NP_TC_mag_guard_and_panel = 1)
