                             1 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             2 *  Axes manual and with handwheel positioning
                             3 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             4 *  Module Description
                             5 *
                             6 *    Axes manual (tip) positioning
                             7 *    Jogging (incremental) positioning
                             8 *    Memory key (conventional) positioning
                             9 *    Rapid traverse
                            10 *    Handwheel
                            11 *    Machine control panel MB 420 (Ident-Nr. 393757-45)
                            12 *
                            13 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            14 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            15 *  Handwheel HR 330
                            16 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            17 *  Module Description
                            18 *    MP 7640: 3
                            19 *
                            20 *    input and output assignment
                            21 *    -----     -----
                            22 *      +  I160   -  I161
                            23 *    -----     -----
                            24 *    -----     -----
                            25 *      ~  I162   ~  I162
                            26 *    -----     -----
                            27 *    The input I162 are only set if plus or minus and the rapid traverse key
                            28 *    are operated.
                            29 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            30 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            31 *  Handwheel HR 410 (Id-No. 296 469-45)
                            32 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            33 *  Module Description
                            34 *    MP 7640: 6
                            35 *    MP 7645: 0
                            36 *
                            37 *    input and output assignment
                            38 *
                            39 *    -----               -----
                            40 *      X                  IV
                            41 *    -----               -----
                            42 *    -----               -----
                            43 *      Y                   V
                            44 *    -----               -----
                            45 *    -----               -----
                            46 *      Z                  Ist
                            47 *    -----               -----
                            48 *    -----     -----     -----
                            49 *     F1        F2        F3         Ist: actual nominal transfer
                            50 *    -----     -----     -----       F1:  low speed
                            51 *    -----               -----       F2:  medium speed
                            52 *      -                   +         F3:  high speed
                            53 *    -----               -----       F/A: function A - spindle start
                            54 *    -----     -----     -----       F/B: function B - NC start
                            55 *     F/A O109  F/B O110  F/C O111   F/C: function C - NC stop
                            56 *    -----I173 -----I174 -----I175
                            57 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
