                             1 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             2 *  FN19 functions
                             3 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             4 *  Module Description
                             5 *    The module has been introduced to start special PLC functions which can
                             6 *    be modified by means of additional data.
                             7 *    With FN19 two double words are transferred to the PLC. In the PLC basic
                             8 *    program the first double word (D280) is used as identifier and the second
                             9 *    one (D284) for data. The functions available in each case are part of the
                            10 *    module description.
                            11 *      Function                        Identifier (D280)  Data (D284)
