                           197 *;EUMACH
                           198 *;For PMC thermal compensation card, if ED11=0 -> + sign, ED11=1 -> - sign.
                           199 *;+ sign means axis must move in the positive direction, and - sign means axis
                           200 *;must move in the negative direction.  However, for TNC control W576-W580,
                           201 *;+ sign means the current position is more than the target position, so it
                           202 *;moves in the negative direction, and vice versa.
                           203     LN     I_PMC_thermal_comp_ED11_sign
                           204     IFT
                           205       L      WL_thermal_comp_value
                           206       X      K-1
                           207       =      WL_thermal_comp_value
