PLCCOMP V5.99  TEMP_CP2.SRC                           Fri Jun 11 16:12:45 2021
                             1 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             2 *  Temperature compensation using table (Spawn)
                             3 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             4 *  Module Description
                             5 *    The label TempCompensation will be called from the cyclical
                             6 *    PLC program.
                             7 *    The module contains the following functions:
                             8 *    1.    Basic initializing of the module
                             9 *    1.1   Submit start to carry out Spawn
                            10 *    2.    Reading Pt100 values
                            11 *    3.    Average calculating of the temperature inputs
                            12 *    4.    Warm up cool down recognition
                            13 *    5.    Spawn start to read data from table
                            14 *    5.1   Neverending repeat loop for spawn
                            15 *    6.    Submit job
                            16 *    6.1   Table file open
                            17 *    6.2   Table file data process
                            18 *    6.3   Initial values read out from table after PGM start
                            19 *    6.3.1 Temp compensation active ? (read)
                            20 *    6.4   Current temperature write in table
                            21 *    6.5   Current temperature search in table and send the value to CNC
                            22 *          for the gliding compensation
                            23 *    6.6   PLC table close
                            24 *    7.    Compensation value read
                            25 *    7.1   Compensation value read out from the table for the corresponding
                            26 *          axis
                            27 *    7.2   Linear interpolation between the compensation points
                            28 *    8.    Initializing from the table
                            29 *    8.1   Initial number of Pt100 interface
                            30 *    8.2   Search for Pt100 interface in KField
                            31 *    8.3   Scaling factor for Pt100 reading
                            32 *    8.4   Number of PLC cycles for average calculating
                            33 *    8.5   Recognition hysteresis for warm up or cool down
                            34 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
