                          1029 EM
                          1030 * Interface assignment and scaling factor for the
                          1031 * PT 100 inputs
                          1032 
                          1033 * Interface assignment on the first PL410
                          1034 * Interface (PA)     module value
                          1035 * X15       (X2)  == 0    analog input
                          1036 * X16       (X3)  == 1    analog input
                          1037 * X17       (X4)  == 2    analog input
                          1038 * X18       (X5)  == 3    analog input
                          1039 * X19       (X7)  == 4    Pt 100 input
                          1040 * X20       (X8)  == 5    Pt 100 input
                          1041 * X21       (X9)  == 6    Pt 100 input
                          1042 * X22       (X10) == 7    Pt 100 input
                          1043 
                          1044 * Interface assignment on the second PL410
                          1045 * Interface (PA)     module value
                          1046 * X15     (X2)  == 8    analog input
                          1047 * X16     (X3)  == 9    analog input
                          1048 * X17     (X4)  == 10   analog input
                          1049 * X18     (X5)  == 11   analog input
                          1050 * X19     (X7)  == 12   Pt 100 input
                          1051 * X20     (X8)  == 13   Pt 100 input
                          1052 * X21     (X9)  == 14   Pt 100 input
                          1053 * X22     (X10) == 15   Pt 100 input
                          1054 
                          1055 * Pt100 assignment on the first PL510
                          1056 * Interface slot     module  module value
                          1057 * X19       0        0        == 400
                          1058 * X20       0        0        == 500
                          1059 * X21       0        0        == 600
                          1060 * X22       0        0        == 700
                          1061 * X19       1        0        == 410
                          1062 * X20       1        0        == 510
                          1063 * X21       1        0        == 610
                          1064 * X22       1        0        == 710
                          1065 * X19       2        0        == 420
                          1066 * X20       2        0        == 520
                          1067 * X21       2        0        == 620
                          1068 * X22       2        0        == 720
                          1069 * X19       3        0        == 430
                          1070 * X20       3        0        == 530
                          1071 * X21       3        0        == 630
                          1072 * X22       3        0        == 730
                          1073 
                          1074 * Pt100 assignment on the second PL510
                          1075 * Interface slot     module  module value
                          1076 * X19     0          1        == 401
                          1077 * X20     0          1        == 501
                          1078 * X21     0          1        == 601
                          1079 * X22     0          1        == 701
                          1080 * X19     1          1        == 411
                          1081 * X20     1          1        == 511
                          1082 * X21     1          1        == 611
                          1083 * X22     1          1        == 711
                          1084 * X19     2          1        == 421
                          1085 * X20     2          1        == 521
                          1086 * X21     2          1        == 621
                          1087 * X22     2          1        == 721
                          1088 * X19     3          1        == 431
                          1089 * X20     3          1        == 531
                          1090 * X21     3          1        == 631
                          1091 * X22     3          1        == 731
                          1092 
                          1093 * Interface assignment on the LE
                          1094 * Interface pin    module value
                          1095 * X48     1,2,3,4    == 67    Pt 100 input
                          1096 * X48     5,6,7,8    == 68    Pt 100 input
                          1097 * X48     9,10,11,12 == 69    Pt 100 input
                          1098 * X48     14,15      == 64    analog input
                          1099 * X48     16,17      == 65    analog input
                          1100 * X48     18,19      == 66    analog input
                          1101 
                          1102 KFIELD Pt100_input
                          1103   K+4                                  ;Pt100 input 0.5 degree resolution
                          1104   K+5                                  ;Scaling factor 0.1 degree resolution
                          1105 
                          1106   K+5
