PLCCOMP V5.99  AXES.SRC                               Fri Jun 11 16:12:45 2021
                             1 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             2 *  Axes Control
                             3 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                             4 *  Module Description
                             5 *  - Clamping mode
                             6 *     The clamping mode can be (de)activated with M11/M10 or FN19. In FN19
                             7 *     you can define on which axes the M-functions have an effect. The first
                             8 *     numerical value is the identifier; its value has to be +99991 if the
                             9 *     clamping mode is inactive, and +99990 for an active clamping mode.
                            10 *     The second numerical value serves to transfer the axes in bit-encoded
                            11 *     form. This value is non-volatile and is maintained until FN19 is output
                            12 *     again.
                            13 *     e.g.:
                            14 *     FN 19: PLC =+99991 / +24 -> Clamping mode in axes 4 and 5 inactive
                            15 *
                            16 *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                            17 
     K4                     18 #define /s    KL_distance_to_go                        K+4
     K10                    19 #define /s    KL_handwheel_axis                        K+10
     K23                    20 #define /s    KL_handwheel_axis_M118                   K+23
     K0                     21 #define /s    KL_actual_value_fixed                    K+0
     K1                     22 #define /s    KL_actual_value_released                 K+1
     K-1                    23 #define /s    KL_inactive                              K-1
     K-1                    24 #define /s    KL_runtime_from_MP                       K-1
     K2                     25 #define /s    KL_servo_drive_release_axis_coded        K+2			  *;EUMACH BASIC 53
