                           721 *;EUMACH Original PLC -> When S% knob is replaced by FMAX% knob, S+%/S100%/S-% key will be used.
                           722 *;       In this case, it will be very strange if I_key_override_S_100 will turn on MG_soft_key_S100_percent
                           723 *;       by one-touch on and one-touch off.
